# Data protection impact assessments

One file per high-risk processing activity: `YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`, drafted with the governance
`dpia` skill and signed off by the DPO. A DPIA is likely required when two or more of these apply:
evaluation or scoring, automated decisions with legal or similar effect, systematic monitoring,
special-category data, large scale, matching or combining datasets, vulnerable data subjects,
innovative technology (including AI on personal data), or processing that prevents people from
exercising a right or using a service.

